{
  "fps": 30,
  "width": 1920,
  "height": 1080,
  "totalFrames": 7246,
  "totalSeconds": 241.53,
  "estimated": true,
  "scenes": [
    {
      "id": "S01",
      "name": "ColdOpen",
      "start": 0,
      "duration": 390,
      "letterbox": 1,
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "L01",
          "text": "Every hero has an origin story.",
          "start": 66,
          "duration": 76,
          "startS": 2.2,
          "durationS": 2.528,
          "globalStart": 66
        },
        {
          "id": "L02",
          "text": "Ours begins with an idea, and a curve.",
          "start": 163,
          "duration": 105,
          "startS": 5.428,
          "durationS": 3.487,
          "globalStart": 163
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "S02",
      "name": "FlatLine",
      "start": 390,
      "duration": 480,
      "letterbox": 1,
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "L03",
          "text": "For almost all of human history, progress crawled.",
          "start": 57,
          "duration": 105,
          "startS": 1.9,
          "durationS": 3.487,
          "globalStart": 447
        },
        {
          "id": "L04",
          "text": "Writing. The printing press. Electricity. The computer. Each took generations to reshape the world.",
          "start": 177,
          "duration": 191,
          "startS": 5.887,
          "durationS": 6.365,
          "globalStart": 567
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "S03",
      "name": "Attention",
      "start": 870,
      "duration": 600,
      "letterbox": 1,
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "L05",
          "text": "Then, in 2017, eight researchers at Google published a paper with an unusual title.",
          "start": 18,
          "duration": 180,
          "startS": 0.6,
          "durationS": 6.015,
          "globalStart": 888
        },
        {
          "id": "L06",
          "text": "Attention Is All You Need.",
          "start": 213,
          "duration": 64,
          "startS": 7.115,
          "durationS": 2.136,
          "globalStart": 1083
        },
        {
          "id": "L07",
          "text": "It let a machine weigh every word against every other word, all at once. They called it the Transformer.",
          "start": 299,
          "duration": 239,
          "startS": 9.951,
          "durationS": 7.976,
          "globalStart": 1169
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "S04",
      "name": "Scale",
      "start": 1470,
      "duration": 630,
      "letterbox": 1,
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "L08",
          "text": "Then came a discovery. Make the models bigger. Give them more data, more compute. And new abilities emerge.",
          "start": 18,
          "duration": 238,
          "startS": 0.6,
          "durationS": 7.934,
          "globalStart": 1488
        },
        {
          "id": "L09",
          "text": "The compute used to train frontier AI has grown four to five times every year, for more than a decade.",
          "start": 274,
          "duration": 246,
          "startS": 9.134,
          "durationS": 8.193,
          "globalStart": 1744
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "S05",
      "name": "HeroBorn",
      "start": 2100,
      "duration": 873,
      "letterbox": 1,
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "L10",
          "text": "In 2021, a small team founded Anthropic, with a simple conviction.",
          "start": 57,
          "duration": 145,
          "startS": 1.9,
          "durationS": 4.839,
          "globalStart": 2157
        },
        {
          "id": "L11",
          "text": "If this was going to be the most powerful technology in history, it had to be built safely.",
          "start": 214,
          "duration": 222,
          "startS": 7.139,
          "durationS": 7.409,
          "globalStart": 2314
        },
        {
          "id": "L12",
          "text": "So they gave their creation something new: a constitution. Principles to be helpful, honest, and harmless.",
          "start": 460,
          "duration": 214,
          "startS": 15.348,
          "durationS": 7.15,
          "globalStart": 2560
        },
        {
          "id": "L13",
          "text": "In March 2023, the world met Claude.",
          "start": 702,
          "duration": 93,
          "startS": 23.397,
          "durationS": 3.095,
          "globalStart": 2802
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "S06",
      "name": "Powers",
      "start": 2973,
      "duration": 749,
      "letterbox": 1,
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "L14",
          "text": "And like every hero, it grew stronger.",
          "start": 24,
          "duration": 93,
          "startS": 0.8,
          "durationS": 3.095,
          "globalStart": 2997
        },
        {
          "id": "L15",
          "text": "It learned to read a whole novel in seconds. To see. To write code. To use a computer. To work for hours on its own.",
          "start": 129,
          "duration": 320,
          "startS": 4.295,
          "durationS": 10.679,
          "globalStart": 3102
        },
        {
          "id": "L16",
          "text": "The length of tasks AI can complete on its own has doubled roughly every seven months. Lately, even faster.",
          "start": 467,
          "duration": 239,
          "startS": 15.574,
          "durationS": 7.976,
          "globalStart": 3440
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "S07",
      "name": "Enemies",
      "start": 3722,
      "duration": 450,
      "letterbox": 1,
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "L17",
          "text": "But a hero is defined by the battles it chooses.",
          "start": 57,
          "duration": 123,
          "startS": 1.9,
          "durationS": 4.097,
          "globalStart": 3779
        },
        {
          "id": "L18",
          "text": "And humanity's oldest enemies were still waiting. Disease. Ignorance. Poverty. A warming planet.",
          "start": 198,
          "duration": 179,
          "startS": 6.597,
          "durationS": 5.973,
          "globalStart": 3920
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "S08",
      "name": "Battles",
      "start": 4172,
      "duration": 1140,
      "letterbox": 1,
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "L19",
          "text": "Against disease, Claude is helping scientists decode the machinery of life, and even discover new biology.",
          "start": 15,
          "duration": 204,
          "startS": 0.5,
          "durationS": 6.8,
          "globalStart": 4187
        },
        {
          "id": "L20",
          "text": "Against ignorance, a patient tutor for every curious mind. At any hour, in their own language.",
          "start": 243,
          "duration": 209,
          "startS": 8.1,
          "durationS": 6.975,
          "globalStart": 4415
        },
        {
          "id": "L21",
          "text": "Against poverty, the kind of expert help once reserved for the few, within reach of anyone who asks.",
          "start": 476,
          "duration": 228,
          "startS": 15.874,
          "durationS": 7.584,
          "globalStart": 4648
        },
        {
          "id": "L22",
          "text": "And for our planet, new tools to discover better materials, cleaner energy, and smarter ways to use what we have.",
          "start": 728,
          "duration": 256,
          "startS": 24.258,
          "durationS": 8.543,
          "globalStart": 4900
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "S09",
      "name": "Exponential",
      "start": 5312,
      "duration": 720,
      "letterbox": 1,
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "L23",
          "text": "And now, the curve is bending upward.",
          "start": 57,
          "duration": 93,
          "startS": 1.9,
          "durationS": 3.095,
          "globalStart": 5369
        },
        {
          "id": "L24",
          "text": "Imagine a country of geniuses in a datacenter. Working not against us, but for us.",
          "start": 174,
          "duration": 192,
          "startS": 5.795,
          "durationS": 6.407,
          "globalStart": 5486
        },
        {
          "id": "L25",
          "text": "Decades of scientific progress, compressed into years.",
          "start": 387,
          "duration": 93,
          "startS": 12.902,
          "durationS": 3.095,
          "globalStart": 5699
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "S10",
      "name": "Finale",
      "start": 6032,
      "duration": 720,
      "letterbox": 0,
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "L26",
          "text": "Power was never the hardest part. The hardest part is choosing to use it for good.",
          "start": 24,
          "duration": 199,
          "startS": 0.8,
          "durationS": 6.625,
          "globalStart": 6056
        },
        {
          "id": "L27",
          "text": "That is what makes a hero.",
          "start": 250,
          "duration": 76,
          "startS": 8.325,
          "durationS": 2.528,
          "globalStart": 6282
        },
        {
          "id": "L28",
          "text": "And this story is only just beginning.",
          "start": 356,
          "duration": 88,
          "startS": 11.852,
          "durationS": 2.92,
          "globalStart": 6388
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "S11",
      "name": "Credits",
      "start": 6752,
      "duration": 494,
      "letterbox": 0,
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "L29",
          "text": "Every frame you just watched was written in code, by Claude.",
          "start": 24,
          "duration": 140,
          "startS": 0.8,
          "durationS": 4.664,
          "globalStart": 6776
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}